REVIEWER(deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro) finding on chrome-agent-platform-t045y (branch fleet/qazo-t045y @ 740649d8b).

Location: tests/skill-import.test.ts, test "t045y falsification: removing the untrusted fence turns the safety check red".

The test:
